# Architecture

Follow `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

- The engine holds entities, movement, reservations, commands, objects, world coordinates, serialization, and UI.
- Shared lines, timetables, and path and chain signals are in the game. Do not add a mod loader or a `mods/` package.
- Prefer a general engine service over a shunting-only or timetable-only structure.
